        "text": "kernel R x ^ (4 / 3 : ℝ) = R ^ (-4 : ℝ) * baseMoment (R⁻¹ • x), with baseMoment x = if ‖x‖ < 1 then ‖x‖ ^ (-8/3 : ℝ) else ‖x‖ ^ (-4 : ℝ) (:24) — on ‖x‖ < R this is R^(-4/3) * ‖x‖^(-8/3), the paper's near-field prefactor"
